msgstr ""
"從符合主機的項目或 ``.netrc`` 中的默認項目讀取登入憑證。這些憑證會取代 URL 或 ``--user`` 及 ``--password`` "
"所提供的憑證。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:87
msgid "``--non-interactive``"
msgstr "``--non-interactive``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:89
msgid ""
"Do not prompt for credentials. Read missing credentials from ``NC_USER`` and"
" ``NC_PASSWORD``."
msgstr "不提示輸入登入憑證。從 ``NC_USER`` 及 ``NC_PASSWORD`` 讀取缺少的憑證。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:90
msgid "``--silent``, ``-s``"
msgstr "``--silent``、``-s``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:92
msgid "Suppress Qt log messages. Does not suppress every console message."
msgstr "隱藏 Qt 日誌訊息，但不會隱藏所有主控台訊息。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:93
msgid "``--trust``"
msgstr "``--trust``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:95
msgid ""
"Accept untrusted TLS certificates. Use only for a controlled diagnostic run;"
" normally fix the certificate trust configuration."
msgstr "接受不受信任的 TLS 憑證。只應在受控的診斷作業中使用；一般情況下應修正憑證信任設定。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:97
msgid "``--httpproxy <url>``"
msgstr "``--httpproxy <url>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:98
msgid "No explicit proxy"
msgstr "不明確指定代理伺服器"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:99
msgid ""
"Set an HTTP proxy using ``http://hostname:port``. This option does not parse"
" proxy credentials in the URL."
msgstr "使用 ``http://hostname:port`` 設定 HTTP 代理伺服器。此選項不會解析 URL 中的代理伺服器登入憑證。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:100
msgid "``--exclude <file>``"
msgstr "``--exclude <file>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:101
msgid "System exclude list"
msgstr "系統排除清單"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:102
msgid ""
"Add an exclude list. The file must exist. Pattern anchoring depends on its "
"filename; see :ref:`desktop-command-line-excludes`."
msgstr ""
"新增排除清單。檔案必須存在。模式的錨定方式取決於檔案名稱；請參閱 :ref:`desktop-command-line-excludes`。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:104
msgid "``--exclude-anchored <file>``"
msgstr "``--exclude-anchored <file>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:106
msgid ""
"Add an exclude list with patterns anchored at the sync root, regardless of "
"the filename."
msgstr "新增排除清單，並將模式固定以同步根目錄為基準，不受檔案名稱影響。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:107
msgid "``--unsyncedfolders <file>``"
msgstr "``--unsyncedfolders <file>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:109
msgid ""
"Read remote folders to exclude from synchronization, one relative path per "
"line. Empty lines and lines starting with ``#`` are ignored."
msgstr "讀取要排除同步的遠端資料夾，每行一個相對路徑。空白行及以 ``#`` 開頭的行會被忽略。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:111
msgid "``--max-sync-retries <number>``"
msgstr "``--max-sync-retries <number>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:112
msgid "``3``"
msgstr "``3``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:113
msgid ""
"Maximum number of follow-up runs when the sync engine requests another sync."
" This is not a general retry count for every failed request."
msgstr "當同步引擎要求再次同步時，最多執行多少次後續同步。這並非所有失敗請求的一般重試次數。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:115
msgid "``--uplimit <number>``"
msgstr "``--uplimit <number>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:116 ../../desktop/commandline.rst:119
msgid "``0`` KB/s"
msgstr "``0`` KB/s"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:117
msgid ""
"Upload speed limit in KB/s (1000 bytes per second). Zero means unlimited."
msgstr "上載速度限制，以 KB/s 計算（每秒 1000 位元組）。零代表不設限制。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:118
msgid "``--downlimit <number>``"
msgstr "``--downlimit <number>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:120
msgid ""
"Download speed limit in KB/s (1000 bytes per second). Zero means unlimited."
msgstr "下載速度限制，以 KB/s 計算（每秒 1000 位元組）。零代表不設限制。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:121
msgid "``-h``"
msgstr "``-h``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:122
msgid "Hidden files included"
msgstr "包含隱藏檔案"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:123
msgid ""
"Include hidden files. This is already the default; ``-h`` does not display "
"help."
msgstr "包含隱藏檔案。這本來就是默認行為；``-h`` 不會顯示說明。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:124
msgid "``--logdebug``"
msgstr "``--logdebug``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:126
msgid "Enable Nextcloud debug logging and send log output to standard output."
msgstr "啟用 Nextcloud 偵錯日誌，並將日誌輸出至標準輸出。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:127
msgid "``--confdir <directory>``"
msgstr "``--confdir <directory>``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:128
msgid "Standard location"
msgstr "標準位置"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:129
msgid ""
"Use a different configuration directory. Does not make the one-run sync "
"inherit all desktop sync settings."
msgstr "使用其他設定目錄。這不代表單次同步會繼承桌面同步的所有設定。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:130
msgid "``--version``, ``-v``"
msgstr "``--version``、``-v``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:131
msgid "Not requested"
msgstr "未要求"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:132
msgid ""
"Display version information and exit. Run this option without the directory "
"and server arguments."
msgstr "顯示版本資訊並結束。執行此選項時不要提供目錄及伺服器參數。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:138
msgid "Credential handling"
msgstr "登入憑證處理"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:140
msgid "Credentials are read in this order:"
msgstr "登入憑證會按以下順序讀取："

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:142
msgid "Username and password in the server URL, if supplied."
msgstr "伺服器 URL 中的用戶名稱及密碼（如有提供）。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:143
msgid ""
"``--user`` and ``--password``, which replace the corresponding URL values."
msgstr "``--user`` 及 ``--password``，取代 URL 中相應的值。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:144
msgid ""
"A matching host or default ``.netrc`` entry when ``-n`` is used, which "
"replaces both values."
msgstr "使用 ``-n`` 時，符合主機的項目或 ``.netrc`` 中的默認項目會取代上述兩個值。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:145
msgid ""
"Prompts for any missing values, or the environment variables below when "
"``--non-interactive`` is used."
msgstr "提示輸入任何缺少的值；使用 ``--non-interactive`` 時，則讀取下列環境變數。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:147
msgid ""
"Prefer a password prompt or a protected ``.netrc`` file over putting "
"passwords in a command or URL."
msgstr "建議使用密碼輸入提示或受保護的 ``.netrc`` 檔案，而非將密碼直接放在指令或 URL 中。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:157
msgid "``NC_USER``"
msgstr "``NC_USER``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:158 ../../desktop/commandline.rst:162
msgid "Unset"
msgstr "未設定"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:159
msgid ""
"Username fallback for a one-run sync with ``--non-interactive``. Only used "
"if no username was supplied by the preceding methods."
msgstr "配合 ``--non-interactive`` 進行單次同步時的備用用戶名稱。只有在上述方法均未提供用戶名稱時才會使用。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:161
msgid "``NC_PASSWORD``"
msgstr "``NC_PASSWORD``"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:163
msgid ""
"Password fallback for a one-run sync with ``--non-interactive``. Only used "
"if no password was supplied by the preceding methods."
msgstr "配合 ``--non-interactive`` 進行單次同步時的備用密碼。只有在上述方法均未提供密碼時才會使用。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:166
msgid ""
"These variables do not supply credentials for the account setup mode below. "
"For transfer overrides shared with the desktop sync engine, see "
":ref:`desktop-environment-variables`. ``nextcloudcmd`` uses an initial chunk"
" size of 100 MiB, a minimum of 5 MB, a maximum of 5 GB, and 6 parallel jobs "
"unless overridden by those variables. It does not read the desktop app's "
"chunk-size settings from ``nextcloud.cfg``."
msgstr ""
"這些變數不會為下述帳戶設定模式提供登入憑證。如需了解與桌面同步引擎共用的傳輸覆蓋設定，請參閱 :ref:`desktop-environment-"
"variables`。除非這些變數另有指定，否則 ``nextcloudcmd`` 使用的初始區塊大小為 100 MiB、最小為 5 MB、最大為 5 "
"GB，並同時執行 6 個工作。它不會從 ``nextcloud.cfg`` 讀取桌面應用程式的區塊大小設定。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:175
msgid "Exclude lists"
msgstr "排除清單"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:177
msgid ""
"The client loads the system exclude list when available. You can add your "
"own list with ``--exclude`` or ``--exclude-anchored``. A missing explicitly "
"supplied file is an error."
msgstr ""
"用戶端會在系統排除清單可用時載入該清單。你可以使用 ``--exclude`` 或 ``--exclude-anchored`` "
"加入自己的清單。若明確指定的檔案不存在，便會發生錯誤。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:180
msgid ""
"With ``--exclude``, a file named ``sync-exclude.lst`` uses the sync root for"
" pattern matching. Other filenames can use the exclude file's directory as "
"the base. Use ``--exclude-anchored`` when the filename and location should "
"not affect matching."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``--exclude`` 時，名為 ``sync-exclude.lst`` "
"的檔案會以同步根目錄作為模式比對基準。其他檔案名稱則可能以排除清單檔案所在目錄作為基準。如果不希望檔案名稱及位置影響比對，請使用 "
"``--exclude-anchored``。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:184
msgid "Write one pattern per line. Wildcards are supported, for example:"
msgstr "每行輸入一個模式。支援萬用字元，例如："

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:193
msgid "Account setup"
msgstr "帳戶設定"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:195
msgid ""
"``nextcloudcmd`` can also save an account for use by the desktop app. The "
"presence of ``--userid`` selects this mode; omit the positional local "
"directory and server URL used for a one-run sync. The command exits after "
"setup completes."
msgstr ""
"``nextcloudcmd`` 亦可儲存帳戶，供桌面應用程式使用。加入 ``--userid`` "
"即會選擇此模式；請勿提供單次同步所用的本機目錄及伺服器 URL 位置參數。設定完成後，指令便會結束。"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:11
msgid "``--userid <user>``"
msgstr "``--userid <user>``"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:12
#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:15
msgid "Required"
msgstr "必填"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:13
msgid "User ID for the account to create."
msgstr "要建立的帳戶之用戶 ID。"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:14
msgid "``--serverurl <url>``"
msgstr "``--serverurl <url>``"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:16
msgid ""
"Base URL of the Nextcloud server, for example ``https://cloud.example.com``."
msgstr "Nextcloud 伺服器的基礎 URL，例如 ``https://cloud.example.com``。"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:17
msgid "``--apppassword <password>``"
msgstr "``--apppassword <password>``"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:19
msgid ""
"App password for the account. If omitted, the account is saved and you must "
"log in from the desktop app later."
msgstr "帳戶的應用程式密碼。如未提供，帳戶仍會儲存，但你需要稍後從桌面應用程式登入。"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:20
msgid "``--localdirpath <path>``"
msgstr "``--localdirpath <path>``"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:21
msgid "Suggested folder"
msgstr "建議的資料夾"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:22
msgid ""
"Local sync folder. If omitted, use the folder suggested by the setup wizard."
" An existing folder must be empty. Ignored when macOS File Provider mode is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"本機同步資料夾。如未提供，會使用設定精靈建議的資料夾。現有資料夾必須為空。啟用 macOS File Provider 模式時會忽略此選項。"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:24
msgid "``--remotedirpath <path>``"
msgstr "``--remotedirpath <path>``"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:25
msgid "``/``"
msgstr "``/``"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:26
msgid ""
"Remote folder for the new classic sync connection. Applies when a local sync"
" folder is created."
msgstr "新傳統同步連線的遠端資料夾。建立本機同步資料夾時適用。"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:27
msgid "``--isvfsenabled <0|1>``"
msgstr "``--isvfsenabled <0|1>``"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:28
msgid "``0``"
msgstr "``0``"

#: ../../../_shared_assets/_desktop_account_setup_options.rst:29
msgid ""
"Use ``1`` to request virtual files for the new classic sync folder, where "
"supported, or ``0`` to download files. This does not enable macOS File "
"Provider mode."
msgstr ""
"在支援的情況下，使用 ``1`` 為新的傳統同步資料夾啟用虛擬檔案，或使用 ``0`` 下載檔案。這不會啟用 macOS File Provider "
"模式。"

#: ../../desktop/commandline.rst:200
msgid ""
"For example, save an account and log in from the desktop app afterward:"
msgstr "例如，儲存帳戶，然後從桌面應用程式登入："
